 11   4010              cell    EQU VARS + 16           ; the place of the last key gone down
 12   4010              ; The BIOS's interrupt reads the keyboard every third frame and puts the
 13   4010              ; characters of the keys in its buffer. The program reads rows 0 to 5 from
 14   4010              ; the ports every frame, keeps the place of the last key gone down, and
